{{!--
  Pinned versions with subresource integrity: a CDN file that does not match its hash is not
  executed, and "@3.x.x"-style URLs could change under us. Bump deliberately.

  htmx 4: fetch-based, explicit attribute inheritance (`:inherited`), morph swaps built in.
  hx-alpine-compat: defers Alpine's mutation observer until htmx has settled and carries x-data
  state through morph swaps; must come before Alpine, and Alpine must be `defer`.
  hx-preload: sidebar links fetch their page on mouseover, so a click swaps instantly.
--}}
